<!-- Play device groups for the NPU runtime modules (npu/), by the chip phones report (Build.SOC_MANUFACTURER and
     Build.SOC_MODEL; Android 12+).
     Snapdragons with Qualcomm's HTP NPU, by Hexagon version (Qualcomm's QNN docs and ExecuTorch's chip table):
     v68: SM8350 (888), SM8350P (888+), SM8325 (SM8325), SM7325 (778G), SM7350 (780G), SM7315 (SM7315)
     v69: SM8450 (8 Gen 1), SM8475 (8+ Gen 1), SM7450 (7 Gen 1), SM7475 (7+ Gen 2)
     v73: SM8550 (8 Gen 2), SM8635 (8s Gen 3), SM7675 (7+ Gen 3), SM6450 (6 Gen 1)
     v75: SM8650 (8 Gen 3)
     v79: SM8750 (8 Elite)
     v81: SM8850 (8 Elite Gen 5), SM8845 (8 Gen 5)
     not published (get v73-v81): SM8735 (8s Gen 4), SM7750 (7 Gen 4), SM7550 (7 Gen 3), SM7635 (7s Gen 3), SM7435 (7s Gen 2), SM6650 (6 Gen 4), SM6475 (6 Gen 3)
     Dimensitys, by NeuroPilot adapter (Google's LiteRT samples; * = LiteRT supports the chip, the sample doesn't list it):
     8: MT6991 (Dimensity 9400), MT6989 (Dimensity 9300), MT6985 (Dimensity 9200), MT6983 (Dimensity 9000), MT6897 (Dimensity 8300), MT6893 (Dimensity 1200/1300), MT6878 (Dimensity 7300), MT6877 (Dimensity 900/1080), MT6879 (MT6879), MT6895 (Dimensity 8100/8200*), MT6886 (Dimensity 7200*), MT6853 (Dimensity 720/800U*)
